<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Payment Overdue – 10 Days Reminder" recipientType="User" relatedToType="SalesOrder__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
<html>
   <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
     <div style="text-align: center;">
          <!-- <img src="{!URLFOR($Resource.CustomerCommunitcationHeader)}" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;" />-->
          <img src="http://cdn.mcauto-images-production.sendgrid.net/e8b0a57e5c62d448/faec48e3-ed7c-4bd7-8c65-56e42990cc99/3000x481.jpg" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"/>

        </div>
        <div style="background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 15px; text-align: Left;">
  <!--<div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">Default SR</div> -->
</div>
     <!--<div style="margin: 0px 20% 0 15%;border: 2px solid black;padding: 2px;">-->
         <table style="text-align:justify;width: 100%;">
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2">
                &nbsp;
             </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
              <td colspan="2" style="">
                  Dear Customer,
              </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2">
                &nbsp;
             </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
            <td colspan="2" style="">
            

This is a friendly reminder that your payment has been overdue for 10 days. We kindly request you to make the pending payment at the earliest to avoid any inconvenience.<br/><br/>

If you have already made the payment, please disregard this message. For any queries or assistance, feel free to contact our support team.<br/><br/>

Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.
                <b></b> <br/><br/>

              

            </td>
           </tr>
           <tr>
             <td colspan="2" style="">
               <br/>Best regards,<br/><br/><b>Customer Management Team</b>
             </td>
           </tr>        
         </table>
             
     <!-- Footer -->
<div style="text-align: Left; background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin-top: 30px;">
<a><b> modon.com</b></a>
<!--<<a href="https://modon.com" style="color: #1F4393; text-decoration: none;">modon.com</a>-->
</div>
<!--</div>-->
  </body>
</html>
</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>